{"title":"Deer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/deer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/deer?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>6,804</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/deer?lv=2\">Lv 2 <span>3,078</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/deer\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td>6,804</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/deer?lv=2\" title=\"Pick level 2\"><td><b>2</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>14</td><td>2.2</td><td>100</td><td class=\"muted\">42 · 3.1 · 300</td><td>3,078</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"deer\" data-map-level=\"0\">Show level 0 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 25 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deer-hide\" title=\"Deer Hide - in 80% of 25 looted corpses, 20 recorded drops, 38 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3fa9e156c59310be536f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deer Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">80% · 20/25</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"berries\" title=\"Berries - in 68% of 25 looted corpses, 17 recorded drops, 35 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d942317ed6a8f10b2d65.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Berries</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">68% · 17/25</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"venison\" title=\"Venison - in 68% of 25 looted corpses, 17 recorded drops, 34 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d9348f1e6eaf331348c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venison</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">68% · 17/25</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 25 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 43 total, 12–31 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/25</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 4% of 25 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/25</span>